WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:03.190
Your agent starts a long job in the terminal.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.760
Then the chat moves on, and the job slides out of sight.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.940
Down here, nobody knows if it finished, or if it passed.

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.430
Forge gives the session a name.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.430
Call it back any time.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.730
Read the screen.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:28.930
Wait for ready.

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.090
Check what’s actually there.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.150
Then close what this task opened.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.210
Only that.

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.810
It needs the Forge daemon.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:47.550
The doctor checks first.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.000
Forge.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:59.810
Keep terminal work alive, visible and testable.
